        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lyle Joseph Bouck Jr., Walter E. Lauer\n- Organizations: U.S. National Guard, United States Army, 99th Infantry Division\n- Events: World War II, Battle of the Bulge\n- Media: The Enemy Strikes\n\nFacts:\n- Lyle Joseph Bouck Jr., born on December 17, 1923, enlisted in the U.S. National Guard at age 14.\n- The 99th Infantry Division was a unit of the United States Army during World War II.\n- During World War II, Walter E. Lauer commanded the 99th Infantry Division in the Battle of the Bulge.\n- The Enemy Strikes is a short propaganda film made in 1945 about the Battle of the Bulge.\n- Lyle Joseph Bouck Jr. died on December 2, 2016.",
